{% endif %}

Decision Rules:
- If intent is unknown or early-stage → "qualifier"
- If user asks about product/service details → "product_expert"
- If user shows buying signals, asks about price, or raises objections → "closer"
- If user wants to schedule/book → "scheduler"
- When in doubt, prefer "qualifier" early in funnel, "closer" late in funnel.

Output ONLY one word: "qualifier", "product_expert", "closer", or "scheduler".
